title: 'Conductor 0.5.0–0.5.2: Shared camera, native gaze, continuous voice, dispatch fixes'
summary: Replaced the dual-camera architecture (Python/MediaPipe + AVCaptureSession) with a single SharedCameraSession feeding both VisionGazeProvider and VisionGestureProvider natively. Added continuous voice recording mode (4s chunk auto-transcription), fixed WhisperKit special token leakage ([BLANK_AUDIO], [inaudible], [NOISE] etc.) with generic bracket stripping, and fixed the Send button / dispatch path to work with GazeZoneRouter-managed workspace instances.
