    resolution: Added startContinuous()/stopContinuous() to WhisperVoiceProvider, auto-started from InputOrchestrator.startVoiceProvider()
    time_to_fix: 15min
  - description: '[BLANK_AUDIO] spam flooding buffer after toggling voice off'
    resolution: Added cleanTranscription() with initially hardcoded token list, then upgraded to generic bracket stripping
    time_to_fix: 10min
  - description: '[inaudible][NOISE] tokens leaking through — case-sensitive hardcoded list missed lowercase variants'
    resolution: Replaced hardcoded token list with generic regex-free bracket removal loop
    time_to_fix: 5min
  - description: Send button disabled even when workspace cell is targeted
    resolution: BufferView disable condition now checks gazeZoneRouter.targetedInstance in addition to gazeRouter.currentTarget; dispatchToTarget() also prefers zone router path
    time_to_fix: 10min
  - description: Disk full (1GB free) caused ENOSPC during edit
    resolution: Cleaned up /private/tmp/claude-501/ temp files to recover 14GB
    time_to_fix: 2min
learnings:
  - macOS only allows one AVCaptureSession per physical camera — multiple providers MUST share a single session
  - WhisperKit outputs many special tokens in mixed case — always use generic bracket stripping, not a hardcoded list
  - GazeZoneRouter sets GazeRouter.shared.setTarget() for backward compat but ManagedInstance.instance can be nil before AX detection, so both target sources must be checked
  - stopContinuous() must flush remaining audio samples for transcription, not discard them silently
  - 'Vision framework VNFaceLandmarks2D: leftPupil/rightPupil may be nil on some macOS versions — use leftEye/rightEye center as fallback'
